new file mode 100644
index 0000000..53028de
--- /dev/null
+++ b/NETA.md
@@ -0,0 +1,54 @@
+# Neta on OpenCode V2
+
+Baseline: OpenCode V2 2.0.3, commit
+`7a31b5c0f76ce1c06befacc09b47b4fc3c71c408`. Integration contract: 2.
+
+This worktree adds a Neta shell to the native OpenTUI/Solid chat. The sibling
+`neta` Node owns workspaces, leaders, missions, access and message admission.
+OpenCode owns model execution, native history, integrations and the composer.
+Claude SDK support is deferred.
+
+From the sibling Neta checkout:
+
+```sh
+bun run setup:opencode
+bun src/cli/main.ts tui
+```
+
+From this checkout, with the sibling Node built:
+
+```sh
+bun run --cwd packages/cli ./src/index.ts neta
+```
+
+Use `/machines`, `/workspace`, `/leader`, `/reset`, `/models`, and `/connect`.
+Use `/me` to open the cross-workspace Me feed. It is a separate destination from
+the current workspace chat: select a card for its evidence, press `i` to compose
+an exact reply, and choose a session when the card has multiple destinations.
+The feed can reveal suppressed history and shows a limited set of explicit
+questions and failures while classification is pending. `j`/`k` move between
+cards; Esc returns to chat. Ctrl+M is not bound: native Move session already
+uses it, and ordinary terminal input can encode Ctrl+M as Enter (CR). `/me`
+does not intercept Enter in the native composer.
+Native standalone session creation/fork/revert controls are disabled in managed
+views. Neta prompts use a private gateway endpoint; V2 model and interrupt routes
+are mediated by Node. Managed actors cannot bypass Neta via native delegation.
+
+Source and packaged managed runtimes share `opencode-neta-v2.db`. First launch
+copies a V1 SQLite database before upstream migrates it. The source databases
+remain untouched. See the sibling `neta/docs/opencode.md` for source selection,
+rollback, development commands and the integration contract.
+
+Validation:
+
+```sh
+bun run --cwd packages/cli typecheck
+bun run --cwd packages/tui typecheck
+bun test --cwd packages/cli test/acp/service.test.ts test/acp/config-option.test.ts test/acp/service-lifecycle.test.ts test/acp/error.test.ts
+bun test --cwd packages/core test/permission.test.ts
+```
+
+The sibling `test/opencode-v2-native.test.ts` exercises real V1 import, V2 ACP,
+reset/restart, model variants, cancellation and errors with a local fake model.
+Set `NETA_TUI_SMOKE=1` for tmux composer/navigation checks. No real provider calls
+are made by that fixture.
